flowchart LR
    A[Classic Dependency Failure] --> B[Timeout / Error]
    B --> C[Retry Budget / Circuit Breaker]
    C --> D[Escalation]

    E[AI Evidence Failure] --> F[Fluent Answer]
    F --> G[Tool / Action]
    G --> H[Customer Impact]
    H --> I[Dispute / Audit Later]

    E --> J[Admissible Evidence Gate Needed]
    J --> K[Defer / Escalate / Hard Stop]
